Scope: Convert the four Stage 2 agent types from opencode sources: `qrspi-questions` (orchestrator — dispatches question generator and reviewers, runs quality/leakage review loops), `qrspi-question-generator` (produces research questions from goals), `qrspi-question-leakage-reviewer` (checks for scope leakage), and `qrspi-question-quality-reviewer` (assesses question clarity and coverage). Each file follows the pi agent type convention with YAML frontmatter and adapted system prompt body.
